t and Save files.<br></li><li><i>Glorious</i> 8-bit pixel graphics.<br></li><li><i>Catchy</i> chiptune music.<br></li><li>Jumping, walljumping, and swinging platform <strong>ACTION</strong>.<br></li><li>Exploring levels to find upgrades and souls.<br></li><li>Buying upgrades and sub-weapons with souls absorbed from fallen foes.<br></li><li><i>Dramatic</i> still-frame cutscenes.<br></li><li><strong>Short</strong> but <i>sweet</i>.</li></ul>",
